# Only the api image builds from the repo root (context `.`); web and bot have
# their own contexts. The api needs api-go/ and bot/ (the shared line parser,
# bot/parse) and nothing else — least of all .env, web/node_modules or ref/.
*
!api-go
!bot
# A secret next to the sources (bot/.env on a server) stays out too.
**/.env
